  data: {
    LLM: 'As declarer, use the talon to strengthen trumps and void a suit for ruffing. As defenders, coordinate to force declarer to use high trumps early.\n\nTrack trumps and honours (Sküs, Mond, and Trump I) to time winning the last trick with Trump I or to prevent it. In Solo, declarer must plan without talon help.\n\nBidding and hold strategy: bid only when hand and talon potential justify the contract; defenders should communicate through leads.',
    Player: 'As declarer, use the talon to strengthen trumps and void a suit for ruffing. As defenders, coordinate to force declarer to use high trumps early.\n\nTrack trumps and honours (Sküs, Mond, and Trump I) to time winning the last trick with Trump I or to prevent it. In Solo, declarer must plan without talon help.\n\nBidding and hold strategy: bid only when hand and talon potential justify the contract; defenders should communicate through leads.',
